      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我刚用手机练了几句中文。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc026_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "是录自己的声音吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc026_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "对，我先听参考，再自己说。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc026_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "感觉怎么样？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc026_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "有些句子很像，有些差很多。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc026_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "你看的是文字相似度，对吧？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc026_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "对。我知道它不是声调分数。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc026_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "这样理解就对了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc026_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "如果识别出来的字不一样，我会再听一次。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc026_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "也可以听自己的录音，比较哪里不一样。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc026_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "开始的时候我不太喜欢听自己的声音。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc026_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "很多人都这样，习惯以后就好了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc026_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "现在我更注意整句话，不只看一个字。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc026_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "这会让语气更自然。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc026_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我每天练六句就够了吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc026_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "够，先保证认真，再慢慢增加。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc026_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "那我今天就做到六句。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc026_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
